User Story:
As a user, I want to search for groups by country, region, or language so that I can quickly find relevant communities.

Acceptance Criteria:
    - A logged in user can search groups
    - The user can search groups with country, region, and or language
    - The search will autofill as a drop down to better match the lables of the dattabase
    - If no groups are found it will prompt you to make a group